@startuml CashFlow_Deployment_View
title CashFlow | Deployment View - Azure de referencia, arquitetura portavel
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowColor #566579
skinparam packageBorderColor #64748B
skinparam packageFontColor #0F172A
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #64748B
skinparam rectangleFontColor #0F172A
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF9E8
hide stereotype

actor "Comerciante e\nadministrador" as people

rectangle "LOCAL | Docker Compose\nSem custo Azure na estimativa" as LOCAL #E8EDF5 {
  rectangle "NGINX + React\nTransactions + Consolidation\nKeycloak + RabbitMQ\nPostgreSQL + observabilidade" as localStack #FFFFFF
}

package "SHARED | Azure" as SHARED #E2EFFB {
  rectangle "Container Registry\nACR Basic" as acr #FFFFFF
  rectangle "DNS publico\nAzure DNS" as dns #FFFFFF
}

package "DEV | Azure East US" as DEV #E8F3FF {
  rectangle "Entrada\nStandard Load Balancer + IPs" as devLb #FFFFFF
  node "AKS DEV | 1 no D4as v5" as devAks #D5E8FF {
    rectangle "NGINX + React\nTransactions + Outbox\nConsolidation + consumer\nRabbitMQ + Keycloak\nOTel + Prometheus + Loki\nTempo + Grafana" as devPods #FFFFFF
    database "PVCs\n3 x P4" as devPvc #FFFFFF
  }
  database "PostgreSQL Flexible Server\nB1ms | 32 GiB" as devPg #FFFFFF
  rectangle "Blob Hot LRS\n20 GB" as devBlob #FFFFFF
  rectangle "Key Vault" as devKv #FFFFFF
}

package "HOM | Azure East US" as HOM #E8F3FF {
  rectangle "Entrada\nStandard Load Balancer + IPs" as homLb #FFFFFF
  node "AKS HOM | 1 no D4as v5" as homAks #D5E8FF {
    rectangle "NGINX + React\nTransactions + Outbox\nConsolidation + consumer\nRabbitMQ + Keycloak\nOTel + Prometheus + Loki\nTempo + Grafana" as homPods #FFFFFF
    database "PVCs\n3 x P4" as homPvc #FFFFFF
  }
  database "PostgreSQL Flexible Server\nB1ms | 32 GiB" as homPg #FFFFFF
  rectangle "Blob Hot LRS\n20 GB" as homBlob #FFFFFF
  rectangle "Key Vault" as homKv #FFFFFF
}

package "PROD | Azure East US" as PROD #D9EEFF {
  rectangle "Entrada\nStandard Load Balancer + IPs" as prodLb #FFFFFF
  node "AKS Standard | 3 nos D4as v5" as prodAks #CCE5FF {
    rectangle "NGINX + React\nTransactions + Outbox\nConsolidation + consumer\nRabbitMQ quorum + Keycloak\nOTel + Prometheus + Loki\nTempo + Grafana" as prodPods #FFFFFF
    database "PVCs\n4 x P10" as prodPvc #FFFFFF
  }
  database "PostgreSQL Flexible Server\nGeneral Purpose D2s v3 + HA" as prodPg #FFFFFF
  rectangle "Blob Hot ZRS\n200 GB" as prodBlob #FFFFFF
  rectangle "Key Vault\nSnapshots: 100 GB estimados" as prodKv #FFFFFF
}

' Fluxos ilustrativos, nao sao regras de rede nem topologia definitiva.
people --> dns : Resolve dominio
dns ..> devLb : DEV
dns ..> homLb : HOM
dns ..> prodLb : PROD
devLb --> devPods : HTTPS externo / HTTP interno
homLb --> homPods : HTTPS externo / HTTP interno
prodLb --> prodPods : HTTPS externo / HTTP interno
devPods --> devPg : SQL
homPods --> homPg : SQL
prodPods --> prodPg : SQL
devPods --> devBlob : Loki / Tempo
homPods --> homBlob : Loki / Tempo
prodPods --> prodBlob : Loki / Tempo
devPods ..> devKv : Segredos
homPods ..> homKv : Segredos
prodPods ..> prodKv : Segredos
acr ..> devAks : Imagens
acr ..> homAks : Imagens
acr ..> prodAks : Imagens

legend bottom
  Arquitetura-alvo, nao implantacao validada.
  LOCAL e independente da nuvem.
  DEV, HOM e PROD possuem clusters e bancos logicos separados.
  Azure e a referencia de custo; AWS e GCP requerem reestimativa.
  Os componentes internos sao workloads sobre nos Kubernetes.
  PostgreSQL e servico gerenciado fora do AKS.
  HTTPS publico, conectividade privada, HA e backup exigem validacao.
endlegend
@enduml
